o/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488500/extras/26e5ef15934b3c5bc52365f14fb4cdd9.mp4?t=1755102822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track monsters through chaotic maps or run before bounty hunters take your head. <br><i><strong>You were once the poacher... now you're the prey.</strong></i><br><br><i><strong>- Why are you hunting Sharp? And why is everyone suddenly after you? </strong></i><br> <br>Join a wild chase to capture the bounty on the adorable monster &quot;Sharp&quot; in a world full of chaos, comedy, and creative twists.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25bc Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bold cartoon visuals and\u00a0comedy</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable Boss-rush combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills. Traits. Weapons from what you hunt.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Track monsters  or get hunted yourself</strong></p></li></ul>",
